OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers fed up after becoming
OL,4,ASizewell C rat-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA country road is becoming a rat-run
OL,7,Ffor the construction of a nuclear power
OL,8,Fstation, according to villagers living
OL,9,Fnearby.
OL,11,FThe B1125 in east Suffolk runs between
OL,12,Fthe A12 at Blythburgh and the B1122,
OL,13,Fpassing by the villages of Westleton
OL,14,Fand Middleton.
OL,16,FMandy Beaumont, who is part of the
OL,17,FB1125 Action Group, said: "After having
OL,18,Fbeen promised that Sizewell C would
OL,19,Fbring improvements to local areas, this
OL,20,Fparticular area is being turned into a
OL,21,Frace track".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
